{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35186","headline":"送江州薛尚书 · 周繇","name":"送江州薛尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匡庐千万峯，影匝郡城中。\n忽佩虎符去，遥疑鸟道通。\n烟霞时满郭，波浪暮连空。\n树翳楼台月，帆飞鼓角风。\n郡斋多岳客，乡户半渔翁。\n王事行春外，题诗寄远公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}